8	We apply all three analyses (\S\ref{sec:cross_arch_analyses}) to the $3 \times 4$ architecture-suite matrix (10 of 12 cells filled; Figure~\ref{fig:result_matrix}, Table~\ref{tab:cross_arch_matrix}).
